                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "First of all, this is a game that as steam states, is on early access, this is not a beta or a finished game but an alpha project.\n\nIt's a whole new concept of gaming that must be polished but but that works as intended most of the time, matches are very chaotic and fun, although for the moment it's recommended to join with your friends due the lack of active players.\n\nThe developer is very friendly and active, always willing to answer the community inquires.\n\nRight now this game isn't for anyone, but for the people interested ina  new experience (always taking in mind that the game is still in development), but it can offer with no doubt lots of fun, especially when playing with friends.\n",
